fpc264irc: GNU binutils 2.30 i386-aout -> EMX (OS/2) a.out for emxbind.  byte, 2026-10-02
- EMX layout: ZMAGIC, text at 0x10000 / file offset 0x400, data at the next 64K boundary
- N_IMP1|N_EXT import symbols are defined (value 0) and the relocations against them are kept
  in the executable (emxbind turns them into LX import fixups); N_IMP2|N_EXT "sym=DLL.ord" kept
