+/* fpc264irc: this target is used for EMX (OS/2) executables, which
+   emxbind turns into LX files.  EMX a.out layout: ZMAGIC, header padded
+   to 0x400 in the file, text at 0x10000, data at the next 64K boundary,
+   text and data sizes rounded to 4K.  Object files (OMAGIC) keep the
+   header-only layout.  */
